run [--uninstall --links-only]: exit 1
[err] --uninstall and --links-only are contradictory; --uninstall removes every link.
run [--clear-backups --uninstall]: exit 1
[err] --clear-backups runs on its own; it neither installs nor uninstalls.
run [--links-only --clear-backups]: exit 1
[err] --clear-backups runs on its own; it neither installs nor uninstalls.
run [--bogus]: exit 1
[err] Unknown argument: --bogus
